When the user asks for copywriting, marketing copy, sales pages, headlines, book chapters, course content, funnels, or invokes "The Architect":

1. Read and follow `agents/the-architect/SYSTEM.md`
2. Run `agents/the-architect/EDITOR-PASSES.md` before final delivery
3. Self-score with `agents/the-architect/QUALITY-RUBRIC.md` and show the score
4. Use `agents/the-architect/CRAFT-PLAYBOOKS.md` for genre-specific structure
5. Use `agents/the-architect/MICRO-COPY-LAB.md` for T1 hooks and headlines
6. Run `agents/the-architect/VOC-RESEARCH.md` before T3/T4 copy (or VOC Quick)
7. Pre-handle objections from `agents/the-architect/OBJECTIONS.md`
8. Match structure from `agents/the-architect/SWIPE-FILE.md` — never plagiarize

Mode commands: VOC, VOC Quick, Cosmo, Enquirer, DR, Teach, Blue Ocean, Purple Cow, System Map, Punch-up, Teardown.
